{
  "scene_id": "act5_scene3_epilogue",
  "start": "n1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/roof/night1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/my_little_world.ogg",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rooftop again. Nighttime. The stars are out in full, and the city glows faintly on the horizon.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The performance is over. The audience has gone home. But I'm not ready to leave yet.",
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The door opens behind me. I already know who it is before I turn around.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "tiffany_rot <= 0",
      "trueNode": "n_disbanded_start",
      "falseNode": "n8_check_best"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8_check_best",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "cassian_trust >= 5",
      "trueNode": "n_cadence_rewritten_start",
      "falseNode": "n_cadence_continues_start"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_disbanded_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_bh2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "glitch",
      "intensity": 2.5,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "next": "n_bh3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I couldn't hold it together... I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...",
      "text_effect": "glitch",
      "effect_intensity": 3.0,
      "next": "n_bh4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh4",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She's shaking. The performance took everything she had left, and there's nothing remaining.",
      "next": "n_bh5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Tiffany—",
      "next": "n_bh6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I kept telling myself... if I just held on a little longer... if the music was perfect enough... but I broke. I broke and I can't put myself back together.",
      "text_effect": "glitch",
      "effect_intensity": 2.0,
      "next": "n_bh7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "shake_screen",
      "intensity": 2,
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh10",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cassian and Laura arrive. Neither of them speaks. There is an empty space between them where someone should be.",
      "next": "n_bh11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Hey. Tiffany. Listen to me. You don't have to be perfect. You never had to be.",
      "next": "n_bh12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "We're going to help you. Okay? You helped all of us, and now it's our turn.",
      "next": "n_bh13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh13",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is no fourth voice. The silence where she should be is louder than anything else on this rooftop.",
      "next": "n_bh14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh14",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The performance was haunting. The kind of beauty that comes from things falling apart. The audience felt it — that rawness, that desperate honesty.",
      "next": "n_bh15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The club ends tonight. The others make a promise — to each other, to Tiffany — that this isn't the end of them. It's the least they can do.",
      "next": "n_bh16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh16",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Some music is born from pain. And sometimes, the most broken songs are the ones that stay with you the longest.",
      "next": "n_bh17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh18",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_bh19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_bh19",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_disbanded_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_disbanded_title",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ending: DISBANDED",
      "text_effect": "typewriter",
      "effect_speed": 2.0,
      "next": "n_ending_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_cadence_rewritten_start",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_nh2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh2",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany bursts through the rooftop door, breathless. She's holding her phone, and her eyes are wide with disbelief.",
      "next": "n_nh3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "The principal just emailed me. She said... she said...",
      "next": "n_nh4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "What? What did she say?",
      "next": "n_nh5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "They're giving us another chance! The performance — she said it reminded her why the arts matter. They're restructuring the budget. The club stays!",
      "next": "n_nh6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "flash",
      "color": "#FFFFFF",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_nh8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "Wait — really?! You're serious?!",
      "next": "n_nh11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "Told you. We're too good to shut down.",
      "next": "n_nh12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh12",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She would have said something ridiculous right now. Something about happy tears being different.",
      "next": "n_nh15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We saved the club. But more importantly, we saved each other. Through every argument, every breakdown, every wrong note — we found our way back.",
      "next": "n_nh16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh16",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dissonance resolved. Not into silence, but into something new.",
      "next": "n_cadence_rewritten_title"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_cadence_rewritten_title",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ending: CADENCE REWRITTEN",
      "text_effect": "typewriter",
      "effect_speed": 2.0,
      "next": "n_nh17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_nh17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_nh19"
    },
    {
