      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n_ec3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec3",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n_ec5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One by one, they all find their way up here. We stand together under the stars, the echo of our music still hanging in the air.",
      "next": "n_ec6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "So. This is it, then.",
      "next": "n_ec7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec7",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "A club is just a room. The music is wherever we are.",
      "next": "n_ec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec8",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "tearful_smile",
      "text": "We'll still practice on weekends, right? Please tell me we'll still practice.",
      "next": "n_ec9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec9",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Someone says her name. No one remembers who started it. But after that, they talk about her for a while. Just talk. Just remember.",
      "next": "n_ec12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec12",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone laughs. It's soft and a little sad, but it's real.",
      "next": "n_ec13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec13",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We walk out of the school together. The gate closes behind us, and the building goes dark.",
      "next": "n_ec14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec14",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n_ec16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_ec15",
